Bundle-Description: The jose.4.j library is a robust and easy to use ope
 n source implementation of JSON Web Token (JWT) and the JOSE specificat
 ion suite (JWS, JWE, and JWK).     It is written in Java and relies sol
 ely on the JCA APIs for cryptography.     Please see https://bitbucket.
 org/b_c/jose4j/wiki/Home for more info, examples, etc..
